{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">ARE YOU SKILLED ENOUGH TO TRAVERSE THE DEATH PIT?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Deep below the surface of The City's endless sprawl, something terrible festers. Six months ago, a gaping hole opened and swallowed an entire city block. Government-contracted drone operators attempted to explore the pit, but the operation was deemed a failure and the program ended.\u00a0Now, the drone-operating software has leaked online and many are trying to fly into the pit to uncover its secrets.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Master a challenging control scheme:</strong>\u00a0Attempt to fly your drone to the bottom of the pit in first person using an unconventional control scheme...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore surreal environments:</strong> Several distinct, challenging, and hand-crafted environments to see...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Effectively manage your drone's power:</strong> Every movement, bump, and action costs energy - don't forget to recharge...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">WARNING this game may induce motion sickness</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3603370?t=1742595651","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603370/7b24feb57a2e7cf1e79e8563da685475dd3559ac/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742595651","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603370/362746e76c3f67bffccfa40f070bc0d91c58f870/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742595651","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3603370/362746e76c3f67bffccfa40f070bc0d91c58f870/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742595651","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam A